'''AAA Wunder''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 8.7 Update#Update 8.7.5|Version 8.7.5]]. It is a variant of [[Mighty Bomburr (Uber Rare Cat)|Mighty Bomburr]]. [[True Form]] was added in [[Version 12.4 Update|Version 12.4]] which increases defense and speed, while reducing time between attacks and granting [[Immune to Slow|Slow Immunity]].

