==Evolution==
Evolves into '''NNN Wunder''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Vanished NNN Wunder''' at level 30 using [[Catfruit]] and XP.

==Strategy/Usage==
AAA wunder's role is without a doubt a nuker, and they perform quite well at it. Their base DPS is already high, standing at 5.7k, and their massive damage boosts it up to ~17k! This allows them to demolish tough Angel and Zombie enemies such as [[Angelic Gory]] and [[Zang Roo]]. The Zombie Killer ability allows them to put Zombies to rest in one go, increasing their performance. Their survivability isn't bad either; 68k health with 5 knockbacks allows them to stay on the battlefield for longer.

They aren't without their flaws however, as they have a sluggish 180 second recharge time. This is extremely inconvenient as both of their targeted traits are some of the strongest pushers. Angels are known for their extremely high DPS and pushing power while Zombies are able to burrow beneath your meatshields and sneak attack Wunder. Their long recharge time doesn't help either as if you do happen to lose Wunder, it'll be another 3 minutes before you deploy another. Overall, AAA Wunder is a solid generalist with a good niche.

